  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.2.0/CHANGELOG.md#120\n\nNew features\n- CascadeInputTransparent and IsClippedToBounds on drawn containers\n- Switch.OffColor (MAUI 10) on SkUiSwitch and SkUiCoreSwitch\n- CheckBox.Command / CommandParameter (MAUI 10) on SkUiCheckBox and SkUiCoreCheckBox\n- MAUI's small members\n- MAUI's gesture recognizers on drawn views\n- The collection view's and carousel's MAUI shape\n- IndicatorTemplate and IndicatorLayout on SkUiIndicatorView\n- SafeAreaEdges (MAUI 10) on drawn containers\n- The migration checker converts",
